00:47:11,360 --> 00:47:15,520
That kind of like we connect your responses from the survey with the usage data.

497
00:47:15,920 --> 00:47:17,760
But it's all anonymous, usually.

498
00:47:18,640 --> 00:47:20,240
So we don't know who you are.

