00:52:48,400 --> 00:53:07,680
but exactly make sure that the user intervention fit is more balanced and suddenly people were very happy to use it and because they could just like do whatever they need to do on Instagram but they would also know that they are kind of like protected from scrolling half an hour without even noticing.

